# Environment files: every variant is ignored by default, including backups the
# earlier rules did not match — `.env.bak` was untracked only by luck, and a
# `git add -A` would have committed real secrets to a public repository. Only the
# intentional, secret-free templates are tracked.
.env*
!.env.example
!.env.sample

# Private migration evidence. docs/windows-migration/ mixes host inventory,
# infrastructure detail and screenshots of a personal media library, and is not
# publishable as it stands. Any public migration documentation must be written
# separately, after sanitisation, in its own directory.
docs/windows-migration/
